# IMPORTANT:
# Keep .maxpat, .maxhelp, .maxproj, .gendsp,
# .genexpr, .js, .mxt and .maxpackage files.
#
# Keep .mxo externals if your project depends on them.
# Keep audio files, samples, recordings and abstractions.


